{"data": [{"author_id": "1900688917902282752", "created_at": "2026-09-23T07:33:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2102662697343160634"], "id": "2102662697343160634", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5376, "like_count": 12, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "我就这样“3¥”“6¥”“8¥”“12¥”“18¥”……的给微信小游戏花了四位数。。。怎会如此！", "url": "https://x.com/icecake999/status/2102662697343160634"}, {"author_id": "1900688917902282752", "created_at": "2026-09-22T16:02:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2102428348983156849"], "id": "2102428348983156849", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 5282, "like_count": 21, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 28, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "我开始反思我到底是想要维持亲密状态还是想跟你这个人保持亲密关系", "url": "https://x.com/icecake999/status/2102428348983156849"}, {"author_id": "1900688917902282752", "created_at": "2026-09-21T17:00:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2102080464228094118"], "id": "2102080464228094118", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5811, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 9, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "朋友说不能再继续宅下去了要开始主动社交。\n我：请展示\n眼睁睁看着她打开手机回复了七月份的消息\n嗯主动回消息也算是主动社交吧嗯", "url": "https://x.com/icecake999/status/2102080464228094118"}, {"author_id": "1900688917902282752", "created_at": "2026-09-21T14:23:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2102041003167547854"], "id": "2102041003167547854", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4608, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 12, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "朋友之前在我胳膊上嘬了一口，三天过去了，红印还没有消失。吸力惊人呐", "url": "https://x.com/icecake999/status/2102041003167547854"}, {"author_id": "1900688917902282752", "created_at": "2026-09-20T04:50:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2101534369366343877"], "id": "2101534369366343877", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 147, "impression_count": 257663, "like_count": 5374, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 273, "retweet_count": 54}, "text": "昨天换了新的四件套所以选择了裸睡。结果朋友早上打开房门就看到我浑身赤裸横躺在床上，因为我爱踢被子所以一点遮挡都没有。。太过尴尬于是两个人都默契当作无事发生。\n刚刚一起吃饭看剧时朋友突然问“你下面为什么没有毛？”我脑子一抽回答“因为我是无毛猫。”\n两个人同时愣住又同时笑喷了。。", "url": "https://x.com/icecake999/status/2101534369366343877"}, {"author_id": "1900688917902282752", "created_at": "2026-09-19T15:03:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2101326259137683752"], "id": "2101326259137683752", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8290, "like_count": 19, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 11, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "你们偷偷亲嘴就亲呗 别发出声音行吗？我还得装听不到", "url": "https://x.com/icecake999/status/2101326259137683752"}, {"author_id": "1900688917902282752", "created_at": "2026-09-18T12:22:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2100923457433374829"], "id": "2100923457433374829", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8811, "like_count": 17, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 37, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "别勾引我了行吗 我受不住任何诱惑的呜呜", "url": "https://x.com/icecake999/status/2100923457433374829"}, {"author_id": "1900688917902282752", "created_at": "2026-09-18T05:52:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2100825307859329442"], "id": "2100825307859329442", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12042, "like_count": 50, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 21, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "做梦梦到跟一个薄肌帅男恋爱，我手都快摸进此男裤裆里了，他说“老师我们这样不好吧”。吓得我直接苏醒。\n救命啊我只是好色而已不要这样害我！！", "url": "https://x.com/icecake999/status/2100825307859329442"}, {"author_id": "1900688917902282752", "created_at": "2026-09-17T06:21:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2100470186759573971"], "id": "2100470186759573971", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7214, "like_count": 21, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 51, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "老公你一定要骚骚的但不能对谁都骚好吗", "url": "https://x.com/icecake999/status/2100470186759573971"}, {"author_id": "1900688917902282752", "created_at": "2026-09-17T05:56:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2100463810440224951"], "id": "2100463810440224951", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6116, "like_count": 11, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "一打开推特就想说点骚话也不知道是为什么", "url": "https://x.com/icecake999/status/2100463810440224951"}, {"author_id": "1900688917902282752", "created_at": "2026-09-16T15:39:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2100248115253293363"], "id": "2100248115253293363", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 15034, "like_count": 140, "quote_count": 5, "reply_count": 14, "retweet_count": 10}, "text": "你根本不是想谈恋爱啊，你只是找个由头让人给你当狗而已", "url": "https://x.com/icecake999/status/2100248115253293363"}, {"author_id": "1900688917902282752", "created_at": "2026-09-13T11:57:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2099105063621058716"], "id": "2099105063621058716", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5793, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "我的食欲在一口吃不下和一直吃不停之间来回切换", "url": "https://x.com/icecake999/status/2099105063621058716"}, {"author_id": "1900688917902282752", "created_at": "2026-09-11T03:37:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2098254553930178749"], "id": "2098254553930178749", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5741, "like_count": 11, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 36, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "学习五分钟 奖励自己玩手机半小时", "url": "https://x.com/icecake999/status/2098254553930178749"}, {"author_id": "1900688917902282752", "created_at": "2026-09-10T00:55:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2097851383789883495"], "id": "2097851383789883495", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5614, "like_count": 12, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 9, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "宅家这段时间的家居服变化：睡衣➡️情趣内衣➡️骚骚的漂亮衣服➡️不穿衣服➡️睡衣 \n总结：情趣内衣穿久了不舒服。穿着漂亮衣服就忍不住照镜子拍照拍视频。不穿衣服不行啊好容易受伤，还是得穿衣服。睡衣最舒服了，可以随地大小睡。", "url": "https://x.com/icecake999/status/2097851383789883495"}, {"author_id": "1900688917902282752", "created_at": "2026-09-08T07:42:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2097228998858391873"], "id": "2097228998858391873", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4897, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "抱着必出神图的心态拍出了一堆能吓哭路人的丑图", "url": "https://x.com/icecake999/status/2097228998858391873"}, {"author_id": "1900688917902282752", "created_at": "2026-09-06T02:17:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2096422501417144692"], "id": "2096422501417144692", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4936, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 16, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "本人的分享欲死掉了。具体表现为：聊两句就开始烦了，被追问两句就开始烦了，一想到聊某件事需要打很多字就烦了。", "url": "https://x.com/icecake999/status/2096422501417144692"}, {"author_id": "1900688917902282752", "created_at": "2026-09-05T09:37:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2096170932549435495"], "id": "2096170932549435495", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4508, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "撒娇男人最好命", "url": "https://x.com/icecake999/status/2096170932549435495"}, {"author_id": "1900688917902282752", "created_at": "2026-09-03T21:44:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2095629063931260953"], "id": "2095629063931260953", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6232, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2094712934052331979", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "原来这种是骚。原来我喜欢骚的。 https://t.co/U3zDbEmdjD", "url": "https://x.com/icecake999/status/2095629063931260953"}, {"author_id": "1900688917902282752", "created_at": "2026-09-03T05:34:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2095384970290409873"], "id": "2095384970290409873", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4212, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "宅家最麻烦的一件事竟然是吃饭。因为我不想吃外卖，自己的厨艺又很一般，就导致吃饭变成了一件很麻烦的事情，人为什么每天都要吃饭…", "url": "https://x.com/icecake999/status/2095384970290409873"}, {"author_id": "1900688917902282752", "created_at": "2026-09-01T04:55:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2094650335084400782"], "id": "2094650335084400782", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4550, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 44, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "高强度自慰的后果就是，现在无论看片还是看小说漫画，下半身都毫无反应。", "url": "https://x.com/icecake999/status/2094650335084400782"}, {"author_id": "1900688917902282752", "created_at": "2026-08-28T04:07:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2093188706916282627"], "id": "2093188706916282627", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 559, "impression_count": 923604, "like_count": 10006, "quote_count": 25, "reply_count": 876, "retweet_count": 98}, "text": "给女生朋友分享我最近爱看的片，其中有一部前半部分几乎都在舔胸，我就说我也好想舔女人的胸肯定很好吃之类的话。朋友沉默几分钟后，突然问我要不要舔她的，有种老实女人一咬牙决定舍身满足朋友的感觉哈哈哈哈哈哈", "url": "https://x.com/icecake999/status/2093188706916282627"}, {"author_id": "1900688917902282752", "created_at": "2026-08-26T18:53:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2092686804852125854"], "id": "2092686804852125854", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 18659, "like_count": 25, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 30, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "想找朋友打电话聊天 结果不是在加班就是在做爱  不是在干就是在干", "url": "https://x.com/icecake999/status/2092686804852125854"}, {"author_id": "1900688917902282752", "created_at": "2026-08-26T18:49:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2092685848500404439"], "id": "2092685848500404439", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 19624, "like_count": 20, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 48, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "辞职在家专心看片", "url": "https://x.com/icecake999/status/2092685848500404439"}, {"author_id": "1900688917902282752", "created_at": "2026-08-26T16:18:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2092647888870686965"], "id": "2092647888870686965", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 17669, "like_count": 10, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 30, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "我跟人聊天的时候很难忍得住不偷对方的表情包….", "url": "https://x.com/icecake999/status/2092647888870686965"}, {"author_id": "1900688917902282752", "created_at": "2026-08-26T14:06:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2092614755865461122"], "id": "2092614755865461122", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1900688917902282752", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 335, "impression_count": 83830, "like_count": 711, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 12, "retweet_count": 20}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2055264982305231215", "type": "quoted"}, {"id": "2092437912713580901", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "是这个https://t.co/zewiKl95P0", "url": "https://x.com/icecake999/status/2092614755865461122"}], "includes": {"tweets": [{"author_id": "1641405645428785159", "created_at": "2026-09-01T09:04:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2094712934052331979"], "id": "2094712934052331979", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1078, "impression_count": 739434, "like_count": 15402, "quote_count": 278, "reply_count": 837, "retweet_count": 1101}, "text": "好想谈骚货男人，会打单边耳钉，会自己剃毛，会在路边问我可不可以亲亲，会把我拽进树丛里深吻，会在房间里突然问我能不能给我口，然后直接在我腿中间干活的内种，还会一边打游戏一边冲我吐舌头勾引我，白天陪我打打游戏，晚上哼唧着求我坐重一点，要射了，想想爽的不行了都"}, {"author_id": "1900688917902282752", "created_at": "2026-08-26T02:24:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2092437912713580901"], "id": "2092437912713580901", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 669, "impression_count": 505812, "like_count": 5072, "quote_count": 4, "reply_count": 583, "retweet_count": 36}, "text": "看片的时候被日女萌晕了。前一秒还被逼得从喉咙深处挤出低吼，声音又沉又哑，听着就感觉人快被撞懵了；下一秒男方一停，她也软下来，脆生生地冒出一句甜甜的“达咩”。好可爱的，我直接被甜晕。"}, {"author_id": "1338827508704190464", "created_at": "2026-05-15T12:32:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2055264982305231215"], "id": "2055264982305231215", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 57514, "impression_count": 11913507, "like_count": 107401, "quote_count": 117, "reply_count": 40, "retweet_count": 9544}, "text": "彼氏にバレないかな〜 https://t.co/dAlma1I4sq"}], "users": [{"id": "190068891790